,{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"166–168"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimeDNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimeDNF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d7f782c53fc50060\" href=\"?note=d7f782c53fc50060\" title=\"27-df-irredundant\">27-df-irredundant</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lc}\">\\(\\operatorname{lc}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"797e67c887b9b035\" href=\"?note=797e67c887b9b035\" title=\"27-df-dnfcost\">27-df-dnfcost</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MinDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=f\\Rightarrow|D|\\leq|E|)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MinDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=f\\Rightarrow|D|\\leq|E|)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{MinDNF}(f)\\cap\\mathrm{PrimeDNF}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{MinDNF}(f)\\cap\\mathrm{PrimeDNF}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LitMinDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=f\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lc}(D)\\leq\\operatorname{lc}(E))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LitMinDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=f\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lc}(D)\\leq\\operatorname{lc}(E))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留 MinDNF 原有的“所有项数最优表示”接口，并新增书中 §3.3 特别选取的 prime 项数最优表示。项数最优不保证每项 prime；文字数最优不能混作项数最优。三个族由有限非空候选集上的最优化良定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-irredundant","status":"resolved","id":"d7f782c53fc50060","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-irredundant]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnfcost","status":"resolved","id":"797e67c887b9b035","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnfcost]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathrm{PrimeDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-irredundant]]，$\\operatorname{lc}$ 见 [[27-df-dnfcost]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-irredundant","status":"resolved","id":"d7f782c53fc50060","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathrm{PrimeDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-irredundant]]，$\\operatorname{lc}$ 见 [[27-df-dnfcost]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnfcost","status":"resolved","id":"797e67c887b9b035","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathrm{PrimeDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-irredundant]]，$\\operatorname{lc}$ 见 [[27-df-dnfcost]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimeDNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MinDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=f\\Rightarrow|D|\\leq|E|)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{MinDNF}(f)\\cap\\mathrm{PrimeDNF}(f).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LitMinDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=f\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lc}(D)\\leq\\operatorname{lc}(E))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1609,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-261","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-mindnf|df-mindnf — Minimum DNF]]"},{"id":"107965fb6156fc4c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"目录中仍可定位的主要约定入口是 [[27-df-hornfunc]]、[[27-df-monotone]]、[[27-df-unate]]、[[27-df-quadfunc]]、[[27-df-quadpb]]、[[27-df-mindnf]] 与 [[27-df-irredundant]]。这些节点分别保留 Horn 的零方程约定、正性与 unate 的区别、两种二次性，以及最少表示与不可约表示的区别。各节点中的旧来源字段只作为原